--- !u!114 &1941582986
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1941582983}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ab8eed0de6e5cd04f8cfbbd6e4286137, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Echoes.Runtime::Echoes.WindmillRestorerInteractable
  prompt: Talk to Alder, the Windmill Restorer
  range: 3
  interactionPoint: {fileID: 0}
  dialogue: {fileID: 697504647}
  objective: {fileID: 1107626476}
  speaker: Alder, the Windmill Restorer
  lockedLines:
  - Mind the loose beams. The windmill has stood silent since the storm.
  - I cannot mend it alone, and not before the garden wakes. Things in this valley
    come back in order.
  offerLines:
  - You woke the garden! Then perhaps you can help me with the windmill.
  - Its supports have snapped. They need braces made of Echo Ore, the pale stone
    that rings like a bell. Four pieces will do.
  - Look along the valley's edge, east and west. Mix the ore into Windmill Braces
    at Mira's workshop, then bring them to me.
  offerWithBracesLines:
  - You woke the garden! Then perhaps you can help me with the windmill.
  - Its supports have snapped, and they need braces of Echo Ore.
  - Is that a set of Windmill Braces you are carrying already? Speak to me again
    and I will fit them.
  deliveredLines:
  - These are perfect. Hold the beam steady...
  - There. Now stand back and listen.
  - The sails are moving! After all these seasons, the windmill is turning.
  - Go and find Mira by the cottage. She has waited a long time to hear this.
  afterLines:
  - Listen to her turn. It sounds as if the whole valley is humming.
  - Mira was asking after you. She is by the workshop cottage.
  afterEndingLines:
  - Listen to her turn. It sounds as if the whole valley is humming.
  - Take as long as you like. The ore will grow back, and so will everything else.
